      "webpage": {
        "text": "2014 Toyota RAV4 LE\n\nThe 2014 Toyota RAV4 LE is a reliable and versatile compact SUV that promises an engaging driving experience and practicality for everyday use. Equipped with a 2.5-liter four-cylinder engine, the RAV4 LE delivers 176 horsepower, paired with a smooth six-speed automatic transmission. Its well-designed cabin offers ample space for five passengers, along with a user-friendly infotainment system and standard features like Bluetooth connectivity, a rearview camera, and a touchscreen display. With its sturdy construction and available all-wheel drive, the RAV4 LE handles diverse road conditions with ease. Its fuel efficiency, achieving up to 24 mpg city and 31 mpg highway, makes it economical for daily commuting and weekend getaways. Combining functionality, comfort, and efficiency, the 2014 RAV4 LE remains a solid choice in the compact SUV segment.\n\n\nEquipment\n\nSeats\n\nDriver seat manual adjustments: height, 6\n\nFront headrests: adjustable, 2\n\nFront seat type: bucket\n\nPassenger seat manual adjustments: 4\n\nRear headrests: adjustable, 3\n\nRear seat folding: one-touch fold flat\n\nRear seat manual adjustments: reclining\n\nRear seat type: 60-40 split bench\n\nUpholstery: cloth\n\nBrakes\n\nABS: 4-wheel\n\nBraking assist:\n\nElectronic brakeforce distribution:\n\nFront brake diameter: 10.8\n\nFront brake type: ventilated disc\n\nPower brakes:\n\nRear brake diameter: 11.2\n\nRear brake type: disc\n\nLights\n\nDaytime running lights:\n\nExterior entry lights: approach lamps\n\nHeadlights: auto delay off, halogen\n\nSafety\n\nCamera system: rearview\n\nChild safety door locks:\n\nChild seat anchors: LATCH system\n\nCrumple zones: front\n\nImpact absorbing seats: dual front\n\nRearview monitor: in dash\n\nSafety brake pedal system:\n\nAirbags\n\nAirbag deactivation: occupant sensing passenger\n\nFront airbags: dual\n\nKnee airbags: driver\n\nSeat cushion airbags: passenger front\n\nSide airbags: front\n\nSide curtain airbags: